sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Attacker
    participant App as App: fetch URL feature
    participant V as Egress validation
    participant M as Cloud metadata service
    A->>App: url=http://169.254.169.254/...
    App->>V: check target
    alt Allowlist + IP check
        V-->>App: blocked
        App-->>A: Request blocked
    else No validation
        V->>M: request passes through
        M-->>App: IAM credentials
        App-->>A: returns body with credentials
    end
    Note over M: IMDSv2 / network policy<br/>is a second layer
